# House Atreides and the Bene Gesserit breeding programme. Frank Herbert, Dune (1965),
# Dune Messiah (1969), Children of Dune (1976). Jessica, a Bene Gesserit, is the
# daughter of Baron Harkonnen, so Paul and Feyd-Rautha are half first cousins once removed.
# Names for Paulus's wife, the Baron's father, Feyd-Rautha's mother, Jessica's mother
# (Gaius Helen Mohiam) and Shaddam's wife (Anirul) are from the Brian Herbert and
# Kevin J. Anderson prequels. Other parents the books do not name are unnamed founders.
# Childless marriages (Paul and Irulan, Alia and Duncan Idaho, Leto II and Ghanima) are
# left out. Ghanima later married Farad'n; their descendants (Moneo, Siona) are one
# unknown-sex node, which also joins the Corrinos to the rest of the pedigree.
# PHENO 2 = Kwisatz Haderach (Paul, and Leto II who took his place).
# Bene Gesserit (Mohiam, Jessica, Anirul, Irulan) carry a "BG" tag in the app; PED has
# no column for it.
# Grandparents
ATRE	Paulus_Atreides	0	0	1	1
ATRE	Helena_Richese	0	0	2	1
ATRE	Dmitri_Harkonnen	0	0	1	1
ATRE	Baron_mother	0	0	2	1
ATRE	Abulurd_mother	0	0	2	1
ATRE	Pardot_Kynes	0	0	1	1
ATRE	Liet_mother	0	0	2	1
# Parents' generation
ATRE	Leto_I	Paulus_Atreides	Helena_Richese	1	1
ATRE	Baron_Harkonnen	Dmitri_Harkonnen	Baron_mother	1	1
ATRE	Abulurd	Dmitri_Harkonnen	Abulurd_mother	1	1
ATRE	Mohiam	0	0	2	1
ATRE	Emmi_Rabban	0	0	2	1
ATRE	Liet_Kynes	Pardot_Kynes	Liet_mother	1	1
ATRE	Chani_mother	0	0	2	1
ATRE	Shaddam_IV	0	0	1	1
ATRE	Anirul	0	0	2	1
# Paul's generation
ATRE	Jessica	Baron_Harkonnen	Mohiam	2	1
ATRE	Rabban	Abulurd	Emmi_Rabban	1	1
ATRE	Feyd_Rautha	Abulurd	Emmi_Rabban	1	1
ATRE	Chani	Liet_Kynes	Chani_mother	2	1
ATRE	Irulan	Shaddam_IV	Anirul	2	1
ATRE	Chalice	Shaddam_IV	Anirul	2	1
ATRE	Wensicia	Shaddam_IV	Anirul	2	1
ATRE	Josifa	Shaddam_IV	Anirul	2	1
ATRE	Rugi	Shaddam_IV	Anirul	2	1
ATRE	Farad_n_father	0	0	1	1
# Children of Leto and Jessica
ATRE	Paul	Leto_I	Jessica	1	2
ATRE	Alia	Leto_I	Jessica	2	1
ATRE	Farad_n	Farad_n_father	Wensicia	1	1
# Children of Paul and Chani
ATRE	Leto_first	Paul	Chani	1	1
ATRE	Leto_II	Paul	Chani	1	2
ATRE	Ghanima	Paul	Chani	2	1
# The line continues
ATRE	Atreides_line	Farad_n	Ghanima	0	1
